# API Client and Data Rules

## Client

- Wrap `openapi-fetch` in `lib/api/client.ts`. Calls go to `/api/proxy/*` only.
- **API contract:** `docs/openapi.json` (in this frontend repo). Generate types with `openapi-typescript` from that file. Regenerate; never hand-edit. CI fails if generated types drift.
- Call only operations that exist in `docs/openapi.json`. Do not invent paths or shapes.
- Every request: fresh `X-Request-Id` (UUID). Surface `requestId` on error screens with a copy button.
- Paths in page specs are relative to `/api/v1`.

## Who may call the client

- **Allowed:** `features/<domain>/api/*`, server components / route handlers, `lib/*` helpers.
- **Forbidden:** `features/*/components/*`, `components/**`, and random `useEffect` fetch in UI.
- Client UI reaches the network only through `features/*/hooks/*` (TanStack Query) that wrap `api/`.
- Keep wrappers fully typed from `src/lib/api/schema.ts` — no untyped `fetch` or `any` responses.

## Unwrap (required)

- Feature `api/*` wrappers must return **unwrapped data** via `unwrap` from `@/lib/api/errors`.
- Never return raw openapi-fetch `{ data?, error? }` from feature APIs.
- Do not copy local `unwrap` / domain `*ApiError` classes — use shared `ApiClientError`.
- Example: `export function fetchInvoices(): Promise<InvoiceDto> { return unwrap(api.GET(...)); }`

## Errors

Shape: `{ statusCode, code, message, details, requestId }`.

Typed client failures throw `ApiClientError` with `mapped: MappedError`. Hooks use `ApiClientError` as the query/mutation error type. UI checks `instanceof ApiClientError`.

| Status / code | UI |
|---|---|
| 400 + `details` | Field errors on the form |
| 409 / 422 | Toast with `message` |
| 403 / 404 | Full-page not-available |
| 5xx / network | Retry banner |
| `LICENSE_READ_ONLY` | Global banner; disable all mutations |
| `MODULE_NOT_LICENSED` | Hide or disable the module entry |
| `INVOICE_ALREADY_PAID` | Message + refresh invoice |

## Money

- Persist/display via `amountMinor` (integer) + currency from school profile.
- `MoneyInput` converts typed decimals with string math — never `parseFloat` for money.

## Lookups

- Fetch `GET /lookups` in root layout; hydrate `LookupProvider`.
- `lookup('fees.invoiceStatus').byCode('paid')` / `.byId(id)`.
- Logic: `code`. Writes: `id`. Badge colours in `lib/lookups/colours.ts`.

## Lists and writes

- Pagination: `{ data, meta: { page, pageSize, total } }`. Keep page/sort/filters in the URL.
- Idempotency: key per user intent (form mount), reuse on retry — payments, checkout, sync. Disable submit while pending.
- Async 202: `{ jobId, statusUrl }` → `useAsyncJob` + `<AsyncJobBanner>`; invalidate queries on terminal status.
- Files: upload `POST /files`, then attach id. Downloads: fresh signed URL; never cache signed URLs.
